{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1484888-theory-liminal-exalted-will-be-given-the-terrestrial-keyword-for-martial-arts","id":1484888,"title":"Theory: Liminal Exalted will be given the Terrestrial keyword for Martial Arts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-24T12:22:16-07:00","id":1484888,"title":"Theory: Liminal Exalted will be given the Terrestrial keyword for Martial Arts","content":"In 2<sup>nd</sup> Edition, Martial Arts styles were separated into three tiers: Terrestrial, Celestial, and Sidereal.<br /> <br /> 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition changed this system by making all Martial Arts styles available to all Exalted and modifying how much power each type of Exalted could gain from each Martial Arts Charm based on keywords. This roughly duplicates the tiers of power seen in 2<sup>nd</sup> Edition without restricting who can learn what style.<br /> <br /> The <b>Terrestrial</b> keyword means that Dragon Blooded gain a lesser effect when using the Martial Arts Charm, while the <b>Mastery</b> keyword means that Solar, Abyssal, and Sidereal Exalted gain a greater effect.<br /> <br /> We know that Lunar Exalted use Martial Arts Charm unmodified by either keyword. If 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition follows the pattern established in 2<sup>nd</sup> Edition, it is reasonable to assume that Infernal and Alchemical Exalted will also use Martial Arts Charms unmodified by keywords.<br /> <br /> So, where does that leave the new kids on the block: the Liminal and Getimian Exalted? I believe that the Liminal Exalted will be assigned the <b>Terrestrial</b> keyword.<br /> <br /> Let\u2019s review the evidence.<br /> <br /> <b>Exhibit A</b>: On pg.286 in <i>Dragon Blooded: What Fire Has Wrought</i>, we have this line describing who can learn Immaculate Martial Arts.<br /> <br /> <i>\u201c<i>The Immaculate styles are intensely demanding. While anyone can learn the fundamentals of the styles, their Charms can only be learned by the Dragon-Blooded and by other martial artists that aren\u2019t restricted by the </i><b><i>Terrestrial</i></b><i> keyword, such as Solars and Sidereals.\u201d</i></i><br /> <br /> When I first read this, I was confused. Dragon Blooded are the <b>only</b> Exalted who are restricted by the <b>Terrestrial</b> keyword (Exalted 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition Core, Pg. 427). Why bother including a line about a restriction that effectively restricts no one?<br /> <br /> I thought that perhaps this meant that Immaculate Martial Arts couldn\u2019t be learned by mortals. Again, it turns out this was a restriction that was already established.<br /> <br /> <b>Exhibit B</b>: Pg. 426 of the 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition Core states:<br /> <br /> <i>\u201cThe Charms of a style are organized into a single tree, which can be learned by any of the Exalted (and certain other powerful supernatural beings).\u201d</i><br /> <br /> So, we\u2019ve established that:<br /> <br /> 1. Only Exalted and other beings of similar power can learn the Charms of supernatural Martial Arts.<br /> 2. Furthermore, the Immaculate Styles can only be learned by the Dragon Blooded and Exalted not restricted by the <b>Terrestrial</b> keyword.<br /> 3. The restriction mentioned in point 2 applies to no currently published type of Exalted.<br /> 4. There are two distinct types of Exalted that are as-yet unpublished.<br /> <br /> Therefore, I postulate that the Liminal Exalted will be also be given the <b>Terrestrial</b> keyword when their books are published.<br /> <br /> By contrast, based on their Primordial patronage and their similarity to the Sidereal Exalted (<i>Arms of the Chosen</i>, pg. 17), I suspect the Getimian Exalted are at <i>least</i> be able to use Martial Arts unmodified by keywords.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>What do we want? 3rd Edition Sidereals!<br /> When do we want it? In accordance with the dictates of Fate!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/867-jimborg","name":"Jimborg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}